# 统一行尾：仓库内一律 LF，检出时按平台转换
* text=auto

*.cs       text diff=csharp
*.md       text
*.ps1      text
*.py       text
*.json     text
*.yml      text
*.yaml     text

# manifest 必须保持 UTF-8：写中文注释会让 SxS 报「并行配置不正确」，
# 该属性只约束 Git 读写编码，不改文件内容。
*.manifest text working-tree-encoding=UTF-8

# 二进制
*.png      binary
*.docx     binary
*.exe      binary
*.dll      binary
